  "description": "Description of Proposed Works\nThe proposed works comprise the demolition of the existing rear kitchen extension and the construction of a new single-storey rear extension to a terraced dwelling at 47 Granville Road, London, E18 1LD. The new extension will accommodate a reconfigured and enlarged kitchen and dining space, improving the internal layout and enhancing connectivity to the rear garden.\n\nKey elements of the proposal include:\n\nA flat roof design featuring two rooflights to maximise natural light.\n\nA full-width elevation incorporating glazed doors to the garden.\n\nExternal finishes to match or complement the existing property.\n\nInternal reconfiguration of the rear ground floor to improve spatial quality and functionality.\n\nThe proposed extension remains subservient in height and scale to the main dwelling and has been designed to minimise impact on neighbouring properties.",
